e\"><li fid=\"ufea58f59\" data-lake-id=\"u72261c87\" id=\"u72261c87\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u215f9da7\" id=\"u215f9da7\">分阶段原理</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u06a2b209\" id=\"u06a2b209\">：ZeRO-1/2/3分别对优化器状态、梯度、参数进行分区存储，显存优化逐级增强 </span></li><li fid=\"ufea58f59\" data-lake-id=\"uea36c697\" id=\"uea36c697\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"udce0f6c2\" id=\"udce0f6c2\">项目锚点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4c56867f\" id=\"u4c56867f\">：选择真实大模型训练案例，突出显存、通信、吞吐量的量化对比</span></li><li fid=\"ufea58f59\" data-lake-id=\"u4a3bbc95\" id=\"u4a3bbc95\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub9fe124c\" id=\"ub9fe124c\">关键技术</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5bd10e84\" id=\"u5bd10e84\">：Offload策略、通信优化、混合精度协同</span></li><li fid=\"ufea58f59\" data-lake-id=\"u7061c7f5\" id=\"u7061c7f5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4073e22c\" id=\"u4073e22c\">决策依据</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uadeea573\" id=\"uadeea573\">：为什么选特定ZeRO阶段？与PP/TP的协同逻辑？</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ufdf69f09\" id=\"ufdf69f09\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"827e9516\" id=\"827e9516\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub1be45ca\" id=\"ub1be45ca\">二、项目案例：130B医疗大模型训练优化</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ua40f4a16\" id=\"ua40f4a16\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751700194582-9526388b-0af1-41ab-8d30-11cac0781658.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u422637cb-62f4-4994-989b-f2cf50f14d3%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue9e68dd0-fa8a-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A376.22222900390625%2C%22height%22%3A267%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A89748%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A783%2C%22originHeight%22%3A556%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFLOAD%E9%85%8D%22%2C%22x%22%3A575%2C%22y%22%3A329%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ZERO%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%22%2C%22x%2